   "text": "Every episode loses most of its audience right away: E1 goes from 67.3 of every 100 watching near the start to 11.8 at the 2% mark, and another 8.1 of every 100 leave around minute 7, roughly where loose 'pull back the curtain' housekeeping chat runs.",
